  "description": ".NET Codabar Barcode Reader on Word SDK is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Codabar and other 2d and 1d barcode formats on Word in your .NET ASP.NET web and Windows apps.\n\n.NET Barcode Reader library is an advanced VB.NET barcode scanner library :\n * Read and decode QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF-417, Code 39 / 128, EAN/UPC, and other barcode formats\n * Scan, detect multiple barcode formats from a single file with fast reading speed and high recognition rate\n * Scan multiple barcodes with different barcode formats from a single image file\n * Reading barcodes from GIF, BMP, JPEG, PNG image files, and stream objects\n * Reading barcodes from Adobe PDF, Microsoft Office Word, Excel, PowerPoint documents and multi-page TIFF image files\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6.1\n\nDocuments\n* How to Guide : http://www.keepdynamic.com/barcoding/vbnet-barcode-reader.shtml\n* Email : support@keepdynamic.com",
